    "name": "SCP: Rulebreaker",
    "steam_appid": 2580210,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the heart of horror with this survival game inspired by the mysterious SCP Foundation.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/8ee955e44b87fa8c9a80a35dd79d1171.poster.avif?t=1742118958\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/8ee955e44b87fa8c9a80a35dd79d1171.webm?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/8ee955e44b87fa8c9a80a35dd79d1171.mp4?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>[/img]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the opening of <strong>Site Samekh</strong>, once a secure bastion of the Foundation, chaos has erupted. All other sites, except for Sites 15 and 19, have been abandoned, converging on the Samekh complex. An unprecedented concentration of anomalies, unleashed during a containment breach, has left the complex in a state of desolation. Take on the role of a Foundation guard, facing the ultimate survival test as the horrors of the anomalies threaten to consume everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> an SCP Foundation complex, once safe, now plunged into madness and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the <strong>radio communications of Tactical Response Officer (TRO) Alex</strong>, trapped in the surveillance room, and uncover the secrets of the complex to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a <strong>variety of anomalies</strong>, each with unique behaviors and mechanics, making every encounter unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your diverse arsenal to fend off anomalies and switch optics (<strong>ACOG, Red Dot, EOTECH</strong>) to adapt to various combat situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy grenades to repel entities, and access crucial areas of the complex using access cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use\u00a0<strong>SCPs like SCP-714 or SCP-005</strong> to assist in your survival quest and tackle unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk, run, and aim</strong> strategically to evade the dangers of the containment breach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use\u00a0<strong>night vision goggles</strong> to explore the dark corners of the complex.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/ba6b04cb968f7c102303748a683f69d5.poster.avif?t=1742118958\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/ba6b04cb968f7c102303748a683f69d5.webm?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/ba6b04cb968f7c102303748a683f69d5.mp4?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the game's fascinating story, particularly the key events triggered by the new director. Search the complex's various computers to understand the situation and unravel the mysteries surrounding you. Immerse yourself in a world where the abnormal becomes the norm, and strategic thinking is the key to facing your deepest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/816589e0f2764202f78d746a140f6bac.poster.avif?t=1742118958\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/816589e0f2764202f78d746a140f6bac.webm?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/816589e0f2764202f78d746a140f6bac.mp4?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the unknown, survive the Samekh complex, and remember:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We work in the shadows so you can live in the light.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fate of the complex now rests in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Are you ready to take on the challenge?</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the heart of horror with this survival game inspired by the mysterious SCP Foundation.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/8ee955e44b87fa8c9a80a35dd79d1171.poster.avif?t=1742118958\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/8ee955e44b87fa8c9a80a35dd79d1171.webm?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/8ee955e44b87fa8c9a80a35dd79d1171.mp4?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>[/img]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the opening of <strong>Site Samekh</strong>, once a secure bastion of the Foundation, chaos has erupted. All other sites, except for Sites 15 and 19, have been abandoned, converging on the Samekh complex. An unprecedented concentration of anomalies, unleashed during a containment breach, has left the complex in a state of desolation. Take on the role of a Foundation guard, facing the ultimate survival test as the horrors of the anomalies threaten to consume everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><