://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the game's fascinating story, particularly the key events triggered by the new director. Search the complex's various computers to understand the situation and unravel the mysteries surrounding you. Immerse yourself in a world where the abnormal becomes the norm, and strategic thinking is the key to facing your deepest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/816589e0f2764202f78d746a140f6bac.poster.avif?t=1742118958\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/816589e0f2764202f78d746a140f6bac.webm?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/816589e0f2764202f78d746a140f6bac.mp4?t=1742118958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the unknown, survive the Samekh complex, and remember:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We work in the shadows so you can live in the light.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fate of the complex now rests in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Are you ready to take on the challenge?</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580210/extras/dccf0d487ca4892fec643f21b38d487d.avif?t=1742118958\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p>",
